---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Navigation from '../components/Navigation.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About MathSonify - The Intersection of Math & Music" description="Learn about MathSonify's mission, technology stack, and privacy-first architecture.">
  <Navigation />

  <main class="min-h-screen pt-20 pb-16 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-16 sc-reveal">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 border border-sc-accent/40 bg-sc-accent/15 rounded-full font-mono text-xs text-sc-accent mb-4" data-i18n="about.tag">
        project manifesto
      </div>
      <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-semibold text-sc-text tracking-tight mb-4" data-i18n="about.title">
        About MathSonify
      </h1>
      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-sc-text-soft leading-relaxed" data-i18n="about.subtitle">
        Building intuitive, creative, and musical bridges into the abstract beauty of mathematics.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Content -->
    <div class="space-y-8 sc-reveal-stagger">
      <div class="panel p-8 space-y-4">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-xl font-semibold text-sc-text" data-i18n="about.missionTitle">Our mission</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-sc-text-soft leading-relaxed" data-i18n="about.missionDesc1">
          Mathematics is often taught as static equations on chalkboard grids. But physical sound itself is mathematics in motion: periodic waveforms, harmonic overtone series, differential equations of resonance, and Fourier decompositions.
        </p>
        <p class="text-sm text-sc-text-soft leading-relaxed" data-i18n="about.missionDesc2">
          MathSonify was created to make mathematics tangible, emotional, and creative. Whether you are a student learning trigonometry, a music producer designing unique timbre palettes, or a creative coder exploring algorithmic beauty, MathSonify lets you hear what numbers look like.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="panel p-8 space-y-4">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-xl font-semibold text-sc-text" data-i18n="about.techTitle">Technical architecture</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-sc-text-soft leading-relaxed" data-i18n="about.techDesc">
          MathSonify is architected to be 100% serverless, private, and zero-cost to maintain:
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs text-sc-text-soft">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="text-sc-accent font-bold">•</span>
            <span data-i18n="about.techAstro"><strong class="text-sc-text">Astro + React hybrid:</strong> fast static delivery for marketing and educational pages, with an isolated, reactive Zustand-driven React island for the studio.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="text-sc-accent font-bold">•</span>
            <span data-i18n="about.techParser"><strong class="text-sc-text">Secure math parser:</strong> powered by <code class="text-sc-accent">mathjs</code> AST parsing. No insecure JavaScript <code class="text-red-400">eval()</code> is ever executed.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="text-sc-accent font-bold">•</span>
            <span data-i18n="about.techAudio"><strong class="text-sc-text">Native Web Audio API:</strong> 100% browser-native real-time polyphonic and microtonal synthesis with custom DSP envelopes, biquad filters, and anti-clipping compressors.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="text-sc-accent font-bold">•</span>
            <span data-i18n="about.techExport"><strong class="text-sc-text">Client-side WAV exporter:</strong> real-time and offline audio buffer rendering converting formulas into standard 16-bit 44.1kHz audio files.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="panel p-8 space-y-4">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-xl font-semibold text-sc-text" data-i18n="about.privacyTitle">Privacy and open access</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-sc-text-soft leading-relaxed" data-i18n="about.privacyDesc">
          MathSonify requires no user account, no login, and no subscription for its core functionality. Your equations are processed directly on your device's CPU and never transmitted to external analytics or database servers.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <div class="mt-16 text-center sc-reveal">
      <a href="/create" class="btn-primary inline-flex items-center px-8 py-3.5 text-base" data-i18n="about.cta">
        Open the sound studio
      </a>
    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>